<title>INDIA: India produced 14,118 tonnes of zinc in November.</title>
<headline>India produced 14,118 tonnes of zinc in November.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 14,118 tonnes of zinc in November 1996 against a target of 13,550 tonnes, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Installed     November 1996	  Cumulative output</p>
<p>	    capacity   --------------------- ---------------------</p>
<p>	    (annual)   Target	 Actual   Apr-Nov 96  Apr-Nov95</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> HZL	149,000    11,050	 11,296     70,534	69,953</p>
<p> BZL	 20,000     2,500	  2,822     18,636	19,337</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total    169,000    13,550	 14,118     89,170	89,290</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional</p>
</text>
